    <!-- Help -->
    <string name="help_title">Where are my files?</string>
    <string name="help_where_title">On your own storage</string>
    <string name="help_where_body">Photos are in Bilder, music in Musikk, films in Video, and what you picked yourself in Valgt. Inside each one, files are filed by year and month.</string>
    <string name="help_phone_title">Your phone is left alone</string>
    <string name="help_phone_body">The app copies. It never deletes anything from the phone, whatever you do in here. If you want to free up space, you do that yourself, afterwards, once you have seen that the files are there.</string>
    <string name="help_computer_title">From a computer</string>
    <string name="help_computer_body">You can also reach the files from a computer at %1$s, with the same username and password you set up here. That is a fallback: everything you need day to day is under "Your files".</string>
    <string name="help_computer_body_unknown">Once the connection is set up, you can also reach the files from a computer with the same username and password.</string>
    <string name="help_wifi_title">Wifi only</string>
    <string name="help_wifi_body">Backing up only runs when the phone is on wifi and has enough battery. Mobile data is never used.</string>
    <string name="help_limits_title">What the app does not do yet</string>
    <string name="help_limits_body">Files over 5 GB are skipped, and you are told which ones. The app never deletes anything on your storage either.</string>

